				<Parameter Group="General">
					<Name>Position Modulo Tolerance Window</Name>
					<Comment><![CDATA[A movement against the specified direction is allowed if the target position is within this position tolerance of the start position. The final behavior depends on 'PositionInterpretation' input of FBs.]]></Comment>
