					<Name>Maximum Velocity</Name>
					<Comment><![CDATA[Maximum limit for velocity that is considered by profile generation. Inputs of FBs might be reduced to this limit automatically. Named constant '#Maximum' will be replaced by this value as FB input for the velocity value.]]></Comment>
