					<Comment><![CDATA[Maximum limit for acceleration that is considered by profile generation. Inputs of FBs might be reduced to this limit automatically. Named constant '#Maximum' will be replaced by this value as FB input for the acceleration value.]]></Comment>
					<BitSize>64</BitSize>
