								<Parameter Group="General">
									<Name>Maximum Absolute Counter Value</Name>
									<Comment><![CDATA[Highest unique encoder position value, e.g. 2^20 - 1 for 20-bit single-turn. The axis position may exceed this during operation but resets to 0..MaxValue after a controller restart.]]></Comment>
